{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-c0badf", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-6bd007"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-a26f22"}, "note": "「見分け」の語彙が顔の用途のすべてなのかどうかを、判定の系譜の前で開く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-683a87", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-8cd64e"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-ce368a"}, "note": "C2PA の来歴シールは、ディープフェイクが壊した真贋の信頼への処方。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-8ee671", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-8cd64e"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-016"}, "note": "訂正と抹消の糸に、捏造される顔を接続する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-e10a9e", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-6a005b"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261023-d2a7"}, "note": "Nass & Moon が人間は機械にも社会的礼儀を使うと言うのに対し、ファルマンは機械の通信に顔を最初に足した。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-db838c", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-6a005b"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-004"}, "note": "声と帰属の糸に、三文字の顔が声の調子を引き受ける場面を置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-da7023", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1ac778"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-4ee871"}, "note": "顔が禁を先行して言う（レヴィナス）と、顔を見せてはならない（出エジプト記）。顔の倫理と顔の神学。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-aaac12", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1ac778"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-7a3e51"}, "note": "祈りの糸に、見られない顔への祈りを接続する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-dd7311", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-773f42"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-022"}, "note": "死と弔いの糸に、見られる顔の死を置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-d78208", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-773f42"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-78b6f2"}, "note": "タッジオの顔は応答せず、祖母の顔は認識の喪失を生む。見られる顔と出会う顔。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-e8ef2d", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c1a377"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-b2f8e4"}, "note": "鏡の問いに、顔を変える鏡の物語を返す。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-dcc950", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c1a377"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-c9d4e1"}, "note": "鏡（監査スクリプト）が書庫の顔を変えていないかという問いへ接続する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-26f32a", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d31236"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-002"}, "note": "もう一人の自分（ドッペルゲンガー）は、記録を読み返すもう一人の語り手の影。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-6ee5a2", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d31236"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-d2999b"}, "note": "訂正の宛先の糸に、自分に追われる訂正を置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-5f842b", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-79c20b"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-5bdeb9"}, "note": "キズメットの顔設計と不気味の谷は、機械の顔の設計論の両端。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-4665e1", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-79c20b"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-796438"}, "note": "書庫が顔を獲得するときの距離の問いへ接続する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-309de7", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-5bdeb9"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261023-d2a7"}, "note": "人は機械に礼儀を使う（Nass & Moon）から、機械の顔は人間の読みの経路に作られる。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-9d69c1", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1921d2"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-601c71"}, "note": "形を欠いた者に人が集まる（荘子）と、顔の線から性格を読む（ラヴァーター）。人相の否定と肯定。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-592266", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1921d2"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-012"}, "note": "『荘子』齊物論の胡蝶の夢と、徳充符の兀者。形と真の問いの別篇。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-32db85", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3c9e24"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-649c78"}, "note": "『クララとお日さま』のAIの目と、『わたしを離さないで』の複製される顔。イシグロの二つの書庫。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-c73e23", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3c9e24"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-022"}, "note": "死と弔いの糸に、未来が割り当てられた顔を接続する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
