{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-a9561b", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-face"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-957fd4"}, "note": "試作後の断片を同じ鏡で数え直す対象として置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-fdb397", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-957fd4"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-09d066"}, "note": "顔写真の制度に、顔の欄のない申請書で応答する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
