{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-9cfb82", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-d9d18c"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-796438"}, "note": "顔を獲得した書庫の距離の問いを、疑問符のまま開く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b82653", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-d9d18c"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-957fd4"}, "note": "顔の欄のない書類と、三文字の顔の断章。対で一つの束。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-41131d", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-a26f22"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-face"}, "note": "実測の「見分け5」を出発点に置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-95f27b", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-957fd4"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-d9d18c"}, "note": "顔の欄のない申請書（情景）と、三文字の顔の断章（省察）は対である。双方向の線で結び、片道断片にしない。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
